Real volunteer observations originate from the authors' CC0-1.0 deposit,
DOI10.5281/zenodo.20085845. Complex encoding images were reconstructed
independently from that deposit using the author's full original acquisition
pipeline; they are MRI observations for the selected velocity inverse.
BART is used only in a private acquisition-verification environment and is
not a cleaned-runtime dependency. No BART or upstream domain solver is shipped.
